"SS-21": "In the plan of the corbel back wall, two kinds of transverse distribution bars are placed along the front edge of the projecting middle zone (upper side of the drawing) and along the rear edge of the back wall (lower side). Which values does the set of their “total length” (共长) entries in the bar schedule contain, each for the full quantity of its bar mark (m)? Do not merge the two marks and do not take the unit length.",
