"SS-25": "From the installation sketch of the drain pipe alone, find the vertical drop between the two ends of the pipe and the vertical drop over the part from the outer edge of the girder slab to the projecting outlet of the pipe; from the plan layout sketch of the drain pipe, find the width by which the water-collecting trough exceeds the outer width of the pipe on each side. Which values does the set of these three dimensions contain (mm)?",
