"SS-40/D": "The full vertical height of section A—A is 144 cm.",
"SS-40/D/why": "Wrong view and end points; the full height on the right outside of A—A is 140.",
"SS-40/E": "In the elevation of the interior girder, the transverse width between the two corners of the box-girder bottom slab is 130 cm.",
"SS-40/E/why": "Wrong range of top and bottom dimensions; the two corners of the bottom slab are marked 100.",
"SS-40/F": "In the plan of the interior girder, the box-girder segment between the projecting parts on the two sides is marked 130 cm.",
