"SS-41/F": "The horizontal projection of the converging segment at the bottom of the main bars is 8.7 cm",
"SS-42": "In the hole layout plan of the support bracket, compute the minimum clear distance, along the length of the member, between the central slotted hole and either end slotted hole; in the assembly section, compute the vertical distance from the lower edge of the post cap to the lower edge of the support bracket; also find the maximum horizontal projected width of the formed bracket. Which values do the results include?",
