"SS-42/D/why": "65 reaches only the upper edge of the support bracket; 70 has to be added to reach the lower edge asked for, 135.",
"SS-42/F/why": "100 is the centre distance from the central hole to an end hole; the half lengths of the two holes, 25 and 14, are not deducted; the clear distance is 61.",
